<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine sets put warrants on S&amp;P 500 Index.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets put warrants on S&amp;P 500 Index.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Tuesday it has launched one billion American-style put warrants on the S&amp;P 500 Index.</p>
<p>10,000 warrants control one index (US$1 per index point)</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	US$765	   PREMIUM	    8.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.0525	GEARING	    11.4x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  19.DEC.97	SETTLEMENT DATE  26.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	EXER LOT	   100,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    US$765	   SETTLEMENT	 CASH</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
